        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016. Published by Elsevier Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "It is known that young children exposed to allergens are prone to develop asthma later in life. In this issue of Immunity, de Kleer et al. (2016) identify IL-33 as a key player in the developing lung for sensitization to environmental allergens and airway hyperreactivity."
